We are pleased to share that Transwest Mongolia LLC successfully participated in the Technical Instructor Qualification Course (TIQC) conducted by Komatsu Academy Asia from 9 to 13 February 2026. This globally standardized program is designed to certify technical instructors against Komatsu Technical Instructor Global Standards.

We are proud to announce that Mr. Munkhbayar Altankhuu, Assistant Manager Technical Training, achieved Gold Level Komatsu Instructor Certification, approved by Komatsu Academy Japan (mother training center). His result reflects excellent performance across technical knowledge, instructional presentation skills, and practical workshop training, with a total average score of 95.3%.

This achievement strengthens Transwest Mongolia’s internal training capability and supports our commitment to safe, high‑quality, and globally aligned technical training. The knowledge and methodologies gained through this certification will be applied to further develop our technical teams and enhance operational performance.

