[3] Modeling and canceling tremor in human-machine interfaces - Robotics Institute Carnegie Mellon University
URL: https://publications.ri.cmu.edu/modeling-and-canceling-tremor-in-human-machine-interfaces
Cameron Riviere and N. V. Thakor
