Mastercard publishes its Site Data Protection noncompliance assessments as Table 2.2 of its Security Rules and Procedures, Merchant Edition. Read the axis carefully, because it is the detail most summaries get wrong: these are per violation, per calendar year, and every figure is an "up to" ceiling. They are not monthly, and they are not ranges.

