Visa does not publish a fine schedule for PCI DSS non-compliance. Its rule on the subject says only that a member deemed non-compliant "is subject to a non-compliance assessment as set out in the Account Information Security (AIS) Program Guide" and Visa does not publish that guide. The same guide holds Visa's merchant level criteria. That is the whole of the public record on it, and it is why no honest source can tell you Visa's number.

