### Average conversion rate

In a Facebook leads campaign, conversion rate shows how effective your ads are at turning interest into action, regardless of whether that’s a sign-up, a form fill, or any other lead conversion event in between.

The average conversion rate in Facebook ads for leads campaigns across all industries is 7.72%—slightly lower than last year’s overall average of 8.67%. The industries that convert at the highest rates for Facebook leads campaigns include Restaurants and Food with a CVR of 18.25%, Attorneys and Legal Services with a CVR of 10.53%, and Education and Instruction with a CVR of 10.05%.

