The honest range is ₹25,000–₹2,50,000+ per month, and the spread reflects genuinely different levels of work. At ₹25,000–₹50,000 you are buying a focused programme — typically local SEO for a single location, a defined keyword set, and a small shared team. At ₹50,000–₹1,00,000 you get a fuller mid-market retainer covering technical, content, links, and reporting with a real team behind it.

Above ₹1,00,000 per month sits serious growth and enterprise work: multi-city or national targeting, broad keyword clusters, sustained content output, consistent link building, and a dedicated strategist. Freelancers exist below this range, often ₹8,000–₹25,000 per month, but at that level you are usually buying one person's part-time attention and a narrow scope, not a full-stack programme.

