`CI compute minute usage` is calculated using the formula: `Job duration / 60 * Cost factor`, where duration is the `running` time for the job in seconds. Some discounts are applied based on the project type on GitLab.com, which would not apply to Dedicated instances.
...
- Duration in seconds (calculated from `started_at` and `finished_at` timestamps)
- CI compute minute usage (with cost factor applied: `Job duration / 60 * Cost factor`)
